#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0077 expect=noViolation domain=MH
#note "MHCAT=GENERAL, GENERAL, blank. A blank is a REAL distinct value to has_same_values (GroupSemantics.hasSameValuesViolations, operator-examples D.3 / Fix #249), so the column has 2 distinct values and the operator is false -- silent even though every POPULATED record holds the same value. Pins the D.3 contract on this rule."
dataset MH label="Medical History"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col MHSEQ type=Num label="Sequence Number"
col MHCAT type=Char label="Category for Medical History" format=$MHCAT.
---
CDISCPILOT01 | MH | 01-701-1015 | 1 | GENERAL
CDISCPILOT01 | MH | 01-701-1015 | 2 | GENERAL
CDISCPILOT01 | MH | 01-701-1023 | 1 |
---
